    },
    {
      "id": "b6d0a17b-6121-4e33-8969-c57cf2371e52",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-03-15T06:04:20.000Z",
      "title": "New minor risk - Share price stability",
      "body": "The company's share price has been volatile over the past 3 months. It is more volatile than 75% of Indian stocks, typically moving 7.6% a week. This is considered a minor risk. Share price volatility indicates the stock is highly sensitive to market conditions or economic conditions rather than being sensitive to its own business performance, which may also be inconsistent. It also increases the risk of potential losses in the short term as the stock tends to have larger drops in price more frequently than other stocks. Currently, the following risks have been identified for the company: Minor Risks Unstable dividend paying track record with dividend experiencing an annual drop of over 20% in the past. Share price has been volatile over the past 3 months (7.6% average weekly change).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "03be42ec-a341-4a61-bc18-57d25e8882aa",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-09T12:10:02.000Z",
      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 16%",
      "body": "After last week's 16% share price gain to ₹801, the stock trades at a trailing P/E ratio of 24.3x. Average forward P/E is 23x in the Professional Services industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 170% over the past three years.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "f0281638-c852-461d-b67b-c19a0c7e482b",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-01-29T11:32:23.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹6.16 (vs ₹12.58 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.16 (down from ₹12.58 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.10b (up 20% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹363.8m (down 51% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 7.1% (down from 18% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.2% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Professional Services industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 4% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 32% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "bdef6082-e675-4fcc-8749-a3665a5e9183",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-01-23T11:57:51.000Z",
      "title": "Now 21% undervalued after recent price drop",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has fallen 28% to ₹649. The fair value is estimated to be ₹822, however this is not to be taken as a buy recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 10% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 6.6%.",
